## 📚 Educational Context

This project was developed as part of the **ALX Software Engineering Program**, focusing on advanced C programming concepts including variadic functions, format specifier implementation, and modular code architecture.

### 🎯 Project Focus Areas
- Custom printf function implementation
- Variadic function mastery
- Format string parsing and processing
- Memory management and optimization
- Modular code design patterns

